\"\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EAbout the Role\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ESuperGaming builds \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eworld-class games played by over 200 million players,\\u003C/strong\\u003E including \\u003Ci\\u003EMaskGun\\u003C/i\\u003E, \\u003Ci\\u003ESilly Royale\\u003C/i\\u003E, \\u003Ci\\u003EIndus Battle Royale\\u003C/i\\u003E, and \\u003Ci\\u003ESuperPlatform\\u003C/i\\u003E (the live-ops engine behind \\u003Ci\\u003EPAC-MAN\\u003C/i\\u003E).\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EWe\\u2019re now bringing that expertise to \\u003Cstrong\\u003ERoblox\\u003C/strong\\u003E, where creativity meets scale.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EWe\\u2019re looking for talented \\u003Cstrong\\u003ERoblox Developers\\u003C/strong\\u003E who love building polished, high-performance experiences that millions of players can enjoy together, whether it\\u2019s a tactical shooter, a social sports world, or a live-ops-driven event space.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EIf you\\u2019re fluent in Lua, obsessed with performance, and thrive on solving complex gameplay and systems challenges, you\\u2019ll fit right in.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EWhat You\\u2019ll Do\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EDevelop, optimize, and ship\\u003C/strong\\u003E Roblox experiences end-to-end using Roblox Studio and Lua scripting.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EImplement \\u003Cstrong\\u003Egameplay systems, UI, and multiplayer features\\u003C/strong\\u003E with clean, maintainable, and scalable code.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ECollaborate with \\u003Cstrong\\u003Edesigners and artists\\u003C/strong\\u003E to turn creative ideas into functional, fun gameplay.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EBuild and balance \\u003Cstrong\\u003EUGC systems, in-game economies, and live-ops features\\u003C/strong\\u003E that keep players engaged.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EContribute to \\u003Cstrong\\u003Ecore architecture decisions\\u003C/strong\\u003E for performance, stability, and scalability across devices.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EDebug, profile, and optimize\\u003C/strong\\u003E gameplay systems for low-end and mobile performance.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EParticipate actively in \\u003Cstrong\\u003Edesign and playtesting sessions\\u003C/strong\\u003E, providing feedback on mechanics, flow, and feel.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EStay updated on \\u003Cstrong\\u003ERoblox platform updates, APIs, and best practices\\u003C/strong\\u003E to push the limits of what\\u2019s possible.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003C/ul\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EWhat You Bring\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003E1+ years of experience\\u003C/strong\\u003E developing on Roblox with Lua scripting.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EDeep understanding of \\u003Cstrong\\u003ERoblox Studio\\u003C/strong\\u003E, gameplay mechanics, and multiplayer systems.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EAbility to \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eprototype quickly\\u003C/strong\\u003E and iterate based on feedback.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EExperience deploying and maintaining \\u003Cstrong\\u003Elive Roblox experiences.\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ESolid understanding of \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eclient-server replication, data stores, and network optimization.\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EStrong problem-solving skills and a love for clean, efficient code.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ECollaborative mindset and should be comfortable working across disciplines in a fast-paced team.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EPassion for creating experiences that players \\u003Ci\\u003Etalk about, share, and come back to.\\u003C/i\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003C/ul\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EBonus Points\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EExperience shipping a \\u003Cstrong\\u003Elive Roblox title\\u003C/strong\\u003E with measurable success.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EKnowledge of \\u003Cstrong\\u003EFree-to-Play (F2P) systems\\u003C/strong\\u003E, progression loops, or in-game economies.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EBackground in \\u003Cstrong\\u003EUnity (C#)\\u003C/strong\\u003E or other modern game engines.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EFamiliarity with \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eanalytics and telemetry tools\\u003C/strong\\u003E for balancing and tuning.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EInterest in \\u003Cstrong\\u003Ecompetitive, shooter, or sports gameplay systems.\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003C/ul\\u003E\\u003Ch3 style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EWhy This Role Matters\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/h3\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ERoblox is rapidly evolving from small creator projects to \\u003Cstrong\\u003Estudio-scale productions\\u003C/strong\\u003E and SuperGaming is at the forefront of that shift.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EWith over \\u003Cstrong\\u003E100M+ daily players\\u003C/strong\\u003E, a maturing audience, and major investments into \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eshooters, sports, and RPGs\\u003C/strong\\u003E, this is a rare opportunity to help shape what the \\u003Cstrong\\u003Enext generation of Roblox experiences\\u003C/strong\\u003E will look and feel like.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EAt SuperGaming, you\\u2019ll be working alongside developers who\\u2019ve \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eshipped global hits\\u003C/strong\\u003E, built \\u003Cstrong\\u003Ecustom live-ops tech\\u003C/strong\\u003E, and understand the \\u003Cstrong\\u003Ebalance between fun, polish, and performance\\u003C/strong\\u003E.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EYou\\u2019ll have the creative freedom to prototype fast, ship boldly, and scale your work to millions of players worldwide.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EWhat You\\u2019ll Get\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EA chance to \\u003Cstrong\\u003Ebuild the next generation of Roblox games\\u003C/strong\\u003E with AAA-level quality and creative freedom.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003ECollaboration with \\u003Cstrong\\u003ERoblox\\u2019s own developer relations and platform teams.\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EThe stability of a proven studio with the agility of a startup strike team.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003EAccess to SuperGaming\\u2019s \\u003Cstrong\\u003ESuperPlatform tools\\u003C/strong\\u003E for live-ops, analytics, and backend services.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/li\\u003E\\u003C/ul\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\u0022background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EJoin SuperGaming and help define what world-class game development on Roblox looks like\\u003C/strong\\u003E\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp style=\\u0022text-align:justify;\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C/p\\u003E\",\n    \"identifier\": {\n        \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\",\n        \"name\": \"SuperGaming\",\n        \"value\": \"291433\"\n    },\n    \"datePosted\": \"2026-06-13\",\n    \"directApply\": true,\n    \"hiringOrganization\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"SuperGaming\",\n        \"sameAs\": \"http://www.supergaming.com\",\n        \"logo\": \"https://gohire-avatars.s3.amazonaws.com/company/11610_full.png\"\n    },\n    \"jobLocatio