v>\n            <div class=\"jp-sidebar-item\">\n              <p class=\"jp-sidebar-item-title\">Job Type</p>\n              <p class=\"jp-sidebar-item-data\">Full-time</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"jp-sidebar-item\">\n              <p class=\"jp-sidebar-item-title\">Date Posted</p>\n              <p class=\"jp-sidebar-item-data\">June 13th, 2026</p>        \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"jp-sidebar-header-share-item-container\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://jobs.gohire.io/supergaming-zikxnf8m/roblox-game-developer-291433/?source=facebook\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"jp-sidebar-header-share-item jp-sidebar-header-share-item-sml facebook\">\n                <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/facebook-white.png\">\n              </a>\n              <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https://jobs.gohire.io/supergaming-zikxnf8m/roblox-game-developer-291433/?source=linkedin\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"jp-sidebar-header-share-item linkedin\">\n                <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/linkedin-white.png\">\n              </a>\n              <a href=\"http://twitter.com/share?url=https://jobs.gohire.io/supergaming-zikxnf8m/roblox-game-developer-291433/?source=twitter\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"jp-sidebar-header-share-item twitter\">\n                <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/twitter-white.png\">\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div onclick=\"apply(); return false;\" class=\"btn primary-btn client-brand-background jp-btn jp-sidebar-primary-btn\"><p>Apply Now</p></div><a href=\"../\" class=\"btn default-btn jp-view-jobs-btn-sml\">\n                  <p>View All Jobs</p>\n                </a> <a class=\"default-btn btn\" href=\"https://api.gohire.io//download-form/?bucket=&key=&type=3&name=\"style=\"margin-top:20px;\"><p>Download File</p></a></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"jp-text\">\n          <div>\n            <p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>About the Role</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">SuperGaming builds <strong>world-class games played by over 200 million players,</strong> including <i>MaskGun</i>, <i>Silly Royale</i>, <i>Indus Battle Royale</i>, and <i>SuperPlatform</i> (the live-ops engine behind <i>PAC-MAN</i>).&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">We’re now bringing that expertise to <strong>Roblox</strong>, where creativity meets scale.</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">We’re looking for talented <strong>Roblox Developers</strong> who love building polished, high-performance experiences that millions of players can enjoy together, whether it’s a tactical shooter, a social sports world, or a live-ops-driven event space.&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">If you’re fluent in Lua, obsessed with performance, and thrive on solving complex gameplay and systems challenges, you’ll fit right in.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Develop, optimize, and ship</strong> Roblox experiences end-to-end using Roblox Studio and Lua scripting.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Implement <strong>gameplay systems, UI, and multiplayer features</strong> with clean, maintainable, and scalable code.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Collaborate with <strong>designers and artists</strong> to turn creative ideas into functional, fun gameplay.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Build and balance <strong>UGC systems, in-game economies, and live-ops features</strong> that keep players engaged.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Contribute to <strong>core architecture decisions</strong> for performance, stability, and scalability across devices.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Debug, profile, and optimize</strong> gameplay systems for low-end and mobile performance.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Participate actively in <strong>design and playtesting sessions</strong>, providing feedback on mechanics, flow, and feel.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Stay updated on <strong>Roblox platform updates, APIs, and best practices</strong> to push the limits of what’s possible.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>What You Bring</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>1+ years of experience</strong> developing on Roblox with Lua scripting.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Deep understanding of <strong>Roblox Studio</strong>, gameplay mechanics, and multiplayer systems.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Ability to <strong>prototype quickly</strong> and iterate based on feedback.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Experience deploying and maintaining <strong>live Roblox experiences.</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Solid understanding of <strong>client-server replication, data stores, and network optimization.</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Strong problem-solving skills and a love for clean, efficient code.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Collaborative mindset and should be comfortable working across disciplines in a fast-paced team.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Passion for creating experiences that players <i>talk about, share, and come back to.</i></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Bonus Points</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Experience shipping a <strong>live Roblox title</strong> with measurable success.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Knowledge of <strong>Free-to-Play (F2P) systems</strong>, progression loops, or in-game economies.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Background in <strong>Unity (C#)</strong> or other modern game engines.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Familiarity with <strong>analytics and telemetry tools</strong> for balancing and tuning.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Interest in <strong>competitive, shooter, or sports gameplay systems.</strong></span></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Why This Role Matters</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Roblox is rapidly evolving from small creator projects to <strong>studio-scale productions</strong> and SuperGaming is at the forefront of that shift.</span><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">With over <strong>100M+ daily players</strong>, a maturing audience, and major investments into <strong>shooters, sports, and RPGs</strong>, this is a rare opportunity to help shape what the <strong>next generation of Roblox experiences</strong> will look and feel like.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">At SuperGaming, you’ll be working alongside developers who’ve <strong>shipped global hits</strong>, built <strong>custom live-ops tech</strong>, and understand the <strong>balance between fun, polish, and performance</strong>.</span><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">You’ll have the creative freedom to prototype fast, ship boldly, and scale your work to millions of players worldwide.</span></p><p><br><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>What You’ll Get</strong></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">A chance to <strong>build the next generation of Roblox games</strong> with AAA-level quality and creative freedom.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Collaboration with <strong>Roblox’s own developer relations and platform teams.</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">The stability of a proven studio with the agility of a startup strike team.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Access to SuperGaming’s <strong>SuperPlatform tools</strong> for live-ops, analytics, and backend services.</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Join SuperGaming and help define what world-class game development on Roblox looks like</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>\n          </div>\n          \n        </div>\n        <div class=\"jp-btm\">\n          <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"apply(); return false;\" class=\"btn primary-btn client-brand-background jp-btn jp-footer-primary-btn\"><p>Apply Now</p></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<footer class=\"careers-footer\">\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"social-links-wrapper\">\n\n\t\n      \n      <a class=\"careers-footer-social-icon\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/14740244/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/linkedin.png\">\n      </a>\n\n    \n      \n      <a class=\"careers-footer-social-icon\" href=\"https://x.com/SuperGamingNPC\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/twitter.png\">\n      </a>\n\n    \n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n  <div class=\"careers-footer-client\">\n    <p>Jobs at SuperGaming</p>\n  </div>\n\n\t\t<a class=\"gh-powered\" href=\"https://gohire.io\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<p>Powered by</p>\n\t\t\t<img src=\"https://gohire-website.s3.amazonaws.com/img/logos/gh-logo-silver.png\">\n\t\t</a>\n\t\n\n</footer>\n\n\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n"
