-developer-172499/?source=twitter\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"jp-sidebar-header-share-item twitter\">\n                <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/twitter-white.png\">\n              </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <a href=\"../\" class=\"btn default-btn jp-view-jobs-btn-sml\">\n                  <p>View All Jobs</p>\n                </a> <a class=\"default-btn btn\" href=\"https://api.gohire.io//download-form/?bucket=&key=&type=3&name=\"style=\"margin-top:20px;\"><p>Download File</p></a></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"jp-text\">\n          <div>\n            <p>At SuperGaming, we are putting India on the Global Gaming map.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">We are close to release of India’s most ambitious game <strong>Indus</strong>, an Indo-futuristic Battle Royale built completely in India.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Last year we made and released <strong>Battle Stars</strong>, a Casual Battle Royale that has been downloaded over 7 Million times and Won Google Play Best Game Made in India.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">In the past we have built games like <strong>MaskGun</strong> (80M users), <strong>Silly Royale</strong> (20M users), SuperPlatform (live ops engine on which <strong>PAC</strong>-<strong>MAN</strong> is built).<br>Join our development team as an iOS Developer Intern to gain hands-on experience in creating and maintaining iOS applications. This role provides an opportunity to learn best practices and contribute to real-world projects.<br><br><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p><ul><li>Assist in designing, developing, and testing iOS apps.</li><li>Collaborate on new features and functionalities.</li><li>Write clean, efficient code.</li><li>Debug and troubleshoot issues.</li><li>Participate in code reviews and team meetings.</li><li>Stay updated on iOS development trends.</li><li>Document project requirements and technical designs.</li><li>Support app deployment and maintenance.</li><li>Optimize app performance.</li></ul><p><strong>Experience &amp; Skills required:</strong></p><ul><li>Currently pursuing a Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.</li><li>Proficiency in Swift programming language and familiarity with Objective-C.</li><li>Understanding of iOS app development concepts, including SwiftUI, App Extensions, widgets and live activities.</li><li>Familiarity with Xcode IDE and Git version control system.</li><li>Passion for learning and mobile app development.</li><li>Knowledge of App Distribution through testflight is desirable.</li></ul>\n          </div>\n           \n    <div class=\"jp-closed box-shadow-03\">\n      <p class=\"careers-job-closed-title\">This job has now closed</p>\n      <p>You can find more jobs over on our careers page.</p>\n      <a href=\"../\" class=\"btn primary-btn client-brand-background careers-closed-btn\"><p>See More Jobs</p></a>\n    </div>\n  \n        </div>\n        <div class=\"jp-btm\">\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<footer class=\"careers-footer\">\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"social-links-wrapper\">\n\n\t\n      \n      <a class=\"careers-footer-social-icon\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/14740244/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/linkedin.png\">\n      </a>\n\n    \n      \n      <a class=\"careers-footer-social-icon\" href=\"https://x.com/SuperGamingNPC\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://jobs.gohire.io/assets/icons/twitter.png\">\n      </a>\n\n    \n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n  <div class=\"careers-footer-client\">\n    <p>Jobs at SuperGaming</p>\n  </div>\n\n\t\t<a class=\"gh-powered\" href=\"https://gohire.io\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<p>Powered by</p>\n\t\t\t<img src=\"https://gohire-website.s3.amazonaws.com/img/logos/gh-logo-silver.png\">\n\t\t</a>\n\t\n\n</footer>\n\n\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n"
